{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MISION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Calamity devastated this small village, stripping it of laughter, voices, and life. You play as a character determined to repair the damage, clean up the homes, and rekindle their hearths\u00a0\u2014 creating comfort so the villagers are no longer afraid to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/5719a090b3adcdf0d8e44f9a4b52d64e.avif?t=1759391678\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras_big/5719a090b3adcdf0d8e44f9a4b52d64e.webp?t=1759391678 width=1560 height=748 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village has 5 houses. Each one needs to be restored \u2014 sometimes with a hammer, sometimes with a broom or a screwdriver. Some repairs also require drawing special &quot;gestures&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/1e60713353368e621e66cb6c8d964a30.poster.avif?t=1759391678\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/1e60713353368e621e66cb6c8d964a30.webm?t=1759391678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/1e60713353368e621e66cb6c8d964a30.mp4?t=1759391678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESIDENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the house is cleaned and the fire is burning in the stove, you have to wait a little. The residents are about to return. You will  have the opportunity to listen to their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/102ae30675d68c65b8baa2e9e2e3e8f8.avif?t=1759391678\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras_big/102ae30675d68c65b8baa2e9e2e3e8f8.webp?t=1759391678 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION AND NARRATIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to Hearth is a game about more than just cleaning houses \u2014 it\u2019s about uncovering the lives once lived within them. Each home holds memories, belongings, amulets, and other details that gradually reveal the villagers\u2019 stories. Some of these items are added to your Collections after interaction, which you can view anytime in the main menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/b322c03e18db34d7460dcbc079867b60.avif?t=1759391678\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short game - 1 hour of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >melancholic fall atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >setting of an Eastern European village, specifically a Ukrainian village</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >casual meditative gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >opportunity to eat apples, grapes, and raspberries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >opportunity to chase after chickens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >personal  and household items that allow you to learn more about the residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collections  (search in the main menu)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >graphic stylization, like in games of the 2000s</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chopped and Bonded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2642760/66aa32d709c5eb4c2b16f0448fb5f054aff55295.jpg"},{"name":"Roots and Threads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2642760/8fe33f5029d0654abb775a31cc9f0bcb72c9825e.jpg"},{"name":"Still Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2642760/9e5eaa28721d20239fae01b03866e1223fbeba8a.jpg"},{"name":"Legacy in the Making","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2642760/a7a1e43a5e4bd4ba082d523094687354c29b86ba.jpg"},{"name":"Home to Stay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2642760/c5207f04d026c954df6df43d6b3f5e0633d6b220.jpg"},{"name":"The Ascension","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2642760/28d9bbf4cd91a17934fcf636246c3a64277634dc.jpg"},{"name":"Gone Picking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2642760/d4f99dfa340816c7d49af97b111eea9c910a77e8.jpg"},{"name":"A Forbidden Fruit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2642760/6f09658d9de2112db6eeba1501e5be48b0f8a2e8.jpg"},{"name":"Among the Vines","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2642760/98c3adb2ebc751a9ccc4e1c4a1af6cf369fe136e.jpg"},{"name":"Gourmand ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2642760/b51a209e989fe77ab836feaed1f17a4723cd65a7.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2642760?t=1759391678","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2642760?t=1759391678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/14e7e65ac14a2c208c5bbcc311a58ce64ffd5e13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759391678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/14e7e65ac14a2c208c5bbcc311a58ce64ffd5e13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759391678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MISION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Calamity devastated this small village, stripping it of laughter, voices, and life. You play as a character determined to repair the damage, clean up the homes, and rekindle their hearths\u00a0\u2014 creating comfort so the villagers are no longer afraid to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/5719a090b3adcdf0d8e44f9a4b52d64e.avif?t=1759391678\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras_big/5719a090b3adcdf0d8e44f9a4b52d64e.webp?t=1759391678 width=1560 height=748 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village has 5 houses. Each one needs to be restored \u2014 sometimes with a hammer, sometimes with a broom or a screwdriver. Some repairs also require drawing special &quot;gestures&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/1e60713353368e621e66cb6c8d964a30.poster.avif?t=1759391678\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/1e60713353368e621e66cb6c8d964a30.webm?t=1759391678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/1e60713353368e621e66cb6c8d964a30.mp4?t=1759391678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESIDENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the house is cleaned and the fire is burning in the stove, you have to wait a little. The residents are about to return. You will  have the opportunity to listen to their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/102ae30675d68c65b8baa2e9e2e3e8f8.avif?t=1759391678\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras_big/102ae30675d68c65b8baa2e9e2e3e8f8.webp?t=1759391678 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION AND NARRATIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to Hearth is a game about more than just cleaning houses \u2014 it\u2019s about uncovering the lives once lived within them. Each home holds memories, belongings, amulets, and other details that gradually reveal the villagers\u2019 stories. Some of these items are added to your Collections after interaction, which you can view anytime in the main menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/extras/b322c03e18db34d7460dcbc079867b60.avif?t=1759391678\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short game - 1 hour of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >melancholic fall atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >setting of an Eastern European village, specifically a Ukrainian village</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >casual meditative gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >opportunity to eat apples, grapes, and raspberries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >opportunity to chase after chickens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >personal  and household items that allow you to learn more about the residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collections  (search in the main menu)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >graphic stylization, like in games of the 2000s</p></li></ul>","developers":["Podoba Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642760/8fb66f52c8c7e2282f4972c7f2b5419cbbdc4e62/header.jpg?t=1759391678","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> both Apple Silicon and Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> both Apple Silicon and Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2642760/1684235273/9c4c3382d63067e6f0d99dd70c6d15321a180196/1758810605/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758811512","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2642760/1684235273/9c4c3382d63067e6f0d99dd70c6d15321a180196/1758810605/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758811512","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2642760/1684235273/9c4c3382d63067e6f0d99dd70c6d15321a180196/1758810605/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758811512","id":257206229,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257206229/25d8fdd58581421872a85e8be00df9f38fc6df8a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758811512"}],"name":"Back to Hearth","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text"